---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Heading from '../../components/Heading.astro';
import {href} from '../../lib/content';
import units from '../../data/learning/units.json';
---
<Layout title="Personalize a Learning Path · 定制学习路径">
<Heading eyebrow="YOUR GOAL. YOUR PACE." title="Personalize your learning path." description="准备匿名需求，再用 Codex 与随附 Skill 生成、校验和预览私有路径。"/>
<p class="tiny">填写内容仅在当前页面内存中，本站不上传、不自动保存。此页准备生成请求；目前没有在线 AI 生成或路径导入功能。</p>
<form autocomplete="off" data-personalize class="intake-form">
<label>Goal · 想学会什么？<input name="goal" required maxlength="1500" placeholder="例如：理解 Transformers，并用公开数据完成文本分类"/></label>
<label>Success criterion · 怎样算完成？<input name="successCriterion" required maxlength="1500" placeholder="例如：能解释注意力，并比较模型的验证结果"/></label>
<div class="intake-grid"><label>Math · 数学基础<select name="math" required><option value="beginner">Beginner · 需要补向量与概率</option><option value="basic">Basic · 学过线性代数与概率</option><option value="advanced">Advanced · 能读数学推导</option></select></label><label>Coding · 编程基础<select name="coding" required><option value="none">None · 尚未编程</option><option value="python-basic">Basic Python · 基础 Python</option><option value="experienced">Experienced · 熟悉编程</option></select></label></div>
<div class="intake-grid"><label>Weekly budget · 每周分钟<input name="weeklyMinutes" type="number" value="120" min="5" max="10080" required/></label><label>Session length · 每次分钟<input name="maxSessionMinutes" type="number" value="30" min="5" max="480" required/></label></div>
<fieldset><legend>Resource preference · 资料偏好</legend><label class="check"><input name="preferredFormats" type="checkbox" value="video" checked/> Video lectures · 视频课</label><label class="check"><input name="preferredFormats" type="checkbox" value="text" checked/> Text & practice · 文字与练习</label><label class="check"><input name="preferredFormats" type="checkbox" value="interactive"/> Interactive · 交互练习</label></fieldset>
<details><summary>Optional context · 基础、资料与第一步</summary><label>Domain · 关注领域<input name="domain" maxlength="1500" placeholder="只写领域；不需要姓名、学校或导师"/></label><label>English comfort · 英文阅读<select name="englishReadingComfort"><option value="needs-Chinese-support">Prefer Chinese support · 需要中文辅助</option><option value="comfortable">Comfortable · 能直接阅读英文</option></select></label><label>First action · 第一项任务<select name="firstSessionMinutes"><option value="5">5 minutes · 分钟</option><option value="10">10 minutes · 分钟</option></select></label><label>Selected local materials · 本地资料名称与主题<textarea name="materials" rows="3" maxlength="1500" placeholder="每行一份资料，仅填名称与相关主题。无需上传原文件。"/></label><details><summary>Explicit prior knowledge · 我已经会的关卡</summary><p class="tiny">仅勾选能完成该关检查的内容。此处不会更新网站学习进度；生成路径仍保留这些前置关卡。</p><div class="known-units">{units.map(u=><label class="check"><input name="explicitlyKnownUnitIds" type="checkbox" value={u.id}/>{u.title.en} · {u.title.zh}</label>)}</div></details></details>
<div class="intake-actions"><button class="button" type="submit" data-intake-submit disabled>Prepare request · 准备生成请求</button><button type="reset" class="text-button">Clear · 清空</button></div>
<script type="application/json" data-unit-ids set:html={JSON.stringify(units.map(u=>u.id))}/>
</form>
<p data-intake-message role="status" aria-live="polite"/>
<section data-intake-output hidden class="intake-result"><h2>Ready for Codex · 交给 Codex</h2><ol><li>下载资料包并解压；在 Codex 中打开 <code>ai-for-engineers-site</code>，按包内 README 建立仅本地的 Git 记录。</li><li>把 <code>profile.json</code> 保存到源码目录以外，将下方请求和随附 <code>skills/personalize-ai-learning-path/SKILL.md</code> 交给 Codex。</li><li>Codex 生成私有计划、校验前置关系；需要时生成独立本地预览。</li></ol><div class="intake-actions"><a class="button" href={href('downloads/ai-learning-kit.zip')} download>Download kit · 源码与 Skill</a><button class="text-button" type="button" data-download-profile>Download profile.json</button><button class="text-button" type="button" data-copy-request>Copy Codex request</button><button class="text-button" type="button" data-download-request>Download request.md</button></div><details><summary>Codex request · 查看完整指令</summary><textarea data-intake-prompt readonly rows="12" aria-label="Codex request"/></details></section>
<details class="learning-rules"><summary>Inputs, files & validation · 需要哪些资料、如何校验？</summary><p>资料包含通用概念、课程链接、33 个学习单元、2 条通用路径、完整生成 Skill、匿名输入模板和校验脚本。它不包含完整课程视频、个人档案或登录凭据。无需先上传额外资料；指定本地笔记时只提供相关匿名片段。</p><p>输入：目标与完成标准、数学和编程基础、时间预算、语言和资料偏好。可选：领域、本地资料及明确声明的已有基础。输出：<code>profile.json</code>、<code>plan.json</code>、<code>plan.md</code>、<code>source-manifest.json</code>，均保存在网站源码外。</p><p>Skill 会复用共享知识 ID，检查全部学习前置、平行分支和必修关系；超过当前 5–8 关限制的目标先生成明确标注的第一阶段。路径生成不会自动点亮知识地图。</p><pre>python3 skills/personalize-ai-learning-path/scripts/path_tools.py validate --repo /absolute/ai-for-engineers-site --plan /absolute/private-plan/plan.json</pre><p>若请求预览，使用 Skill 的 <code>preview</code> 命令生成新的临时目录，再运行 <code>npm run verify</code>。网站的 Progress import 仅导入学习记录，不导入个性化路径。使用云端 AI 时，提交的档案或资料片段会交给该服务；本地保存不代表离线推理。</p><a href={href('downloads/ai-learning-kit.zip')} download>Download public kit · 下载通用资料包 →</a></details>
<noscript><p>问卷需要 JavaScript。也可以下载资料包，按其中的匿名模板手动填写并交给 Codex。</p><a href={href('downloads/ai-learning-kit.zip')} download>Download kit</a></noscript>
</Layout>
<script>import '../../scripts/personalize';</script>
<style>
.intake-form,.intake-result{max-width:820px;margin:30px 0;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px}.intake-form>label,.intake-form details>label{display:block;margin:18px 0}.intake-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:18px 0}.intake-form input:not([type=checkbox]),.intake-form select,.intake-form textarea,.intake-result textarea{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:10px;font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;box-sizing:border-box}.intake-form fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:22px 0}.check{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline;margin:8px 0}.intake-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;align-items:center;margin:22px 0}.known-units{max-height:350px;overflow:auto}.intake-form details{margin:18px 0}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:600px){.intake-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intake-form,.intake-result{padding:18px}}
</style>
